<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello to all,<br><br>I installed Open GD77 on by Baofeng DM1701but I cant get get DMR to work. No receiving and no transmitting. I went by the Manual, watched several YT Videos and even tried to different CP wich i downloaded. The Repeaters are in reach, most of them work also on 70cm or 2m FM. FM works with noch issues. I tried the different Parrots, called on the lokal Repeaters etc. but no reaction. I put it on scan "All Channels",and i found a Repeater where once and a while the green LED flashes. But no tone, even if i turn the Squelch off. I am pretty sure that i have something overlooked or wrong programmed, but according to the Manual it looks ok.<br><br>I have a Radioddity DB-25 D wich i wrote the CP for a few weeks before and it works. Not the way i would like to, but better than nothing <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_razz.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":P" title="Razz">  But on the other side , that whole DMR-Thing is complete new to me.<br><br>Maybe someone as a tip, checklist, a "How to", or whatever it takes to get that radio to work.<br><br>Thank you. 73 DA6VK</div></blockquote><br>If DMR is not working at all, you may have NOT used the DONOR FILE properly during FW Loading...<br><br>Are you sure you have exactly followed the OpenGD77 FW installation directions on its manual??<br><br>Latest CPS,<br>Latest OpenGD77 FW ZIP file for you radio model,<br>Donor file ..<br><br>Let us know.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=101">EA3FA</a> — Wed Jun 04, 2025 8:43 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
